{"unit_id":"hyqhyq3__dsh-mcp-manager#card-zh","repo":"hyqhyq3/dsh-mcp-manager","commit":"0bfd26227a40be8426b52a0106bdbc53e6e3d65e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager 是 DSH 网页端的 MCP 服务器管理插件，可在 Settings → MCP 添加和维护远程 HTTP 与本地 stdio 服务器，并把服务器提供的工具注册到 DSH 会话。它支持浏览器 OAuth、静态令牌或无鉴权 HTTP 连接，提供工作区级服务器配置、连接状态与诊断查看，以及可选的按需搜索和调用工具。适合需要把多个 MCP 工具源接入 DSH、按项目隔离配置或减少会话初始工具目录的用户；需要 DSH web profile，远程服务认证按服务器配置选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-45","lib/index.js:2214-2270","lib/index.js:4191-4250","lib/client.js:620-776"]}
{"unit_id":"hyqhyq3__dsh-mcp-manager#card-en","repo":"hyqhyq3/dsh-mcp-manager","commit":"0bfd26227a40be8426b52a0106bdbc53e6e3d65e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mcp-manager manages HTTP and local stdio MCP servers in DSH Settings → MCP, registering their tools in sessions. HTTP supports OAuth, static-token, or no-auth access. The UI manages workspace servers and offers on-demand tool search and calls. Requires a DSH web profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-45","lib/index.js:2214-2270","lib/index.js:4191-4250","lib/client.js:620-776"]}
