{"unit_id":"hyqhyq3__dsh-mcp-manager#feature-http-servers","repo":"hyqhyq3/dsh-mcp-manager","commit":"0bfd26227a40be8426b52a0106bdbc53e6e3d65e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager 的功能「远程 HTTP 服务器」：在 MCP 设置页添加 HTTP 端点并选择 OAuth、静态令牌或无鉴权模式；插件连接后将服务端工具注册到 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:4191-4250","lib/index.js:3020-3072"]}
{"unit_id":"hyqhyq3__dsh-mcp-manager#feature-stdio-servers","repo":"hyqhyq3/dsh-mcp-manager","commit":"0bfd26227a40be8426b52a0106bdbc53e6e3d65e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager 的功能「本地 stdio 服务器」：在设置中填写命令、参数、工作目录和环境变量；插件以子进程通过标准输入输出进行 MCP 通信并注册工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2410-2496","lib/client.js:377-525"]}
{"unit_id":"hyqhyq3__dsh-mcp-manager#feature-workspace-config","repo":"hyqhyq3/dsh-mcp-manager","commit":"0bfd26227a40be8426b52a0106bdbc53e6e3d65e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager 的功能「工作区服务器」：在选定工作区下维护独立 MCP 服务配置，并把该工作区的工具接入对应会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3248-3365","lib/client.js:620-745"]}
