{"unit_id":"hyqhyq3__dsh-mcp-manager#feature-connection-status","repo":"hyqhyq3/dsh-mcp-manager","commit":"0bfd26227a40be8426b52a0106bdbc53e6e3d65e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager 的功能「服务器管理与状态查看」：设置页列出服务器连接状态，支持添加、编辑、启用、禁用和删除，并可查看连接诊断记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:288-376","lib/index.js:4191-4250"]}
